1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,100
I'm done waiting.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,667
Jax jams his fingers into the door
seal and pulls.

3
00:00:06,367 --> 00:00:08,533
Let go! Rule two! The doors stay shut!

4
00:00:09,233 --> 00:00:13,433
Open doors mean people on the tracks.
People on the tracks can't be counted.

5
00:00:14,133 --> 00:00:16,267
Fine. But if we cook in here, that's
on you.

6
00:00:16,967 --> 00:00:20,233
Rule six. Water first, not food. Share
it in small sips.

7
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:25,333
Six bottles of water for forty-one
people. A bag of pretzels nobody
wants.

8
00:00:26,033 --> 00:00:28,733
Kids first. Then the old man. Then
everyone else.

9
00:00:29,433 --> 00:00:31,167
Here. You can have some of mine.

10
00:00:31,867 --> 00:00:33,300
Thanks, kid. I mean it.

11
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:36,867
I've got two more bottles in my bag.
Pass them around.
